    "detailed_description": "&quot;Super-highspeed-battle&quot; among motorcycles on highways in Asia.<br>That is the \u201cRing-shaped FASTBEAT BATTLE RIDER\u201d!<br>The popular motorbike game in the arcade is back on PC!<br>Players become original characters, and through leveling up and customization, they can create their &quot;own character&quot; and their &quot;own bike&quot; to aim to become No. 1.<br>In this game, cars on the highway may get in your way during battles.<br>Getting caught in cars is very dangerous, but dodging them successfully will increase the player's speed!<br>Improve your technique and turn a difficulty into an opportunity, and defeat your rivals!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Story mode</h2>The story consists of 36 episodes.<br>Defeat the rivals (COM) that stand in your way one after another!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603650/extras/af3fdae8b231acf0e035b0acd19bcb75.avif?t=1710464420\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Time attack mode</h2>Since there are no rivals, improve your driving techniques as much as you are satisfied to reach the fastest course record!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603650/extras/66e1477babc3218e5290fe33196f5680.avif?t=1710464420\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Battle mode</h2>You can battle with other players! Be the fastest among your friends!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603650/extras/e090768677c6bf8502585fec6d3423bb.avif?t=1710464420\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Customization</h2>Get points by playing the game!<br>Play in numerous races to level up the machine!<br>Through customization, not only the performance of the machine, but also the appearance of it can be changed!<br>Moreover, you can obtain &quot;titles&quot; when you meet specific requirements! Show off your style to your friends and opponents!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603650/extras/5ab890f11f1b46e35b9fc63671570a04.avif?t=1710464420\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Super-highspeed-battle&quot; among motorcycles on highways in Asia.<br>That is the \u201cRing-shaped FASTBEAT BATTLE RIDER\u201d!<br>The popular motorbike game in the arcade is back on PC!<br>Players become original characters, and through leveling up and customization, they can create their &quot;own character&quot; and their &quot;own bike&quot; to aim to become No. 1.<br>In this game, cars on the highway may get in your way during battles.<br>Getting caught in cars is very dangerous, but dodging them successfully will increase the player's speed!<br>Improve your technique and turn a difficulty into an opportunity, and defeat your rivals!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Story mode</h2>The story consists of 36 episodes.<br>Defeat the rivals (COM) that stand in your way one after another!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603650/extras/af3fdae8b231acf0e035b0acd19bcb75.avif?t=1710464420\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Time attack mode</h2>Since there are no rivals, improve your driving techniques as much as you are satisfied to reach the fastest course record!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603650/extras/66e1477babc3218e5290fe33196f5680.avif?t=1710464420\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Battle mode</h2>You can battle with other players! Be the fastest among your friends!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603650/extras/e090768677c6bf8502585fec6d3423bb.avif?t=1710464420\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25a0Customization</h2>Get points by playing the game!<br>Play in numerous races to level up the machine!<br>Through customization, not only the performance of the machine, but also the appearance of it can be changed!<br>Moreover, you can obtain &quot;titles&quot; when you meet specific requirements! Show off your style to your friends and opponents!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1603650/extras/5ab890f11f1b46e35b9fc63671570a04.avif?t=1710464420\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "I will be entitled &quot;the fastest&quot;! Slip between the cars that try to block you on your motorbike and run through the highway in a &quot;super-highspeed-battle'' just like in movies! The more you use the machine, the higher the status will be. Improve your skills and defeat the first Ghost Rider!",
